              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wamphendula uSawule, wathi: “Ngingumboni; khiphani phambi kwami endaweni ephakemeyo; ngoba namuhla uzodla Nami, futhi kusasa ngizokukhulula futhi ngikutshele konke okusenhliziyweni yakho.",
