              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawule waphendula wathi: “Angisiye owakwaBenjamini yini, omncane wezizwe zakwa-Israyeli na? nesizukulwane sami sibe sincane kuzo zonke izizukulwana zesizwe sakwaBenjamini? pho kungani ukhuluma nami kanjalo?",
          "type": "text",
