              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpheki wathatha ihlombe nalokho okwakuphezu kwalo, wakubeka phansi phambi kukaSawule. USamuweli wathi: “Bheka, okusele; Kubeke phambi kwakho, udle, ngokuba kuze kube manje kugcinelwe wena kusukela ngathi: Ngimemile abantu. Ngakho uSawule wadla noSamuweli ngalolo suku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
