              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebevuka ekuseni kakhulu, kwathi sekuntsukwini uSamuweli wabiza uSawuli phezu kwendlu, wathi: Vuka, ukuze ngikuyeke uhambe. USawule wayesemqeda, baphuma bobabili, yena noSamuweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
